SSAqua_Interior18_Text_PokefanColinIntro::
	.string "Hey, son!\n"
	.string "Want to battle with me?$"

SSAqua_Interior18_Text_PokefanColinDefeat::
	.string "You’re strong!$"

SSAqua_Interior18_Text_PokefanColin::
	.string "You’re traveling all alone?\p"
	.string "Isn’t your mom worried?$"

SSAqua_Interior18_Text_TwinsMegAndPegIntro::
	.string "You think I’m a baby?\n"
	.string "That’s not fair!$"

SSAqua_Interior18_Text_TwinsMegAndPegDefeat::
	.string "Oh! We lost!$"

SSAqua_Interior18_Text_TwinsMegAndPeg::
	.string "Baby is a rude name to call us\n"
	.string "girls!$"

SSAqua_Interior18_Text_TwinsMegAndPeg2Intro::
	.string "I’m not a baby!\p"
	.string "That’s not nice to say to a lady"
SSAqua_Interior18_Text_TwinsMegAndPeg2Defeat::
	.string "!$"

SSAqua_Interior18_Text_TwinsMegAndPeg2::
	.string "Sometimes, kids are smarter than\n"
	.string "grown-ups!$"

SSAqua_Interior18_Text_PokefanJeremyIntro::
	.string "What do you think?\n"
	.string "My POKéMON are beautiful, yes?$"

SSAqua_Interior18_Text_PokefanJeremyDefeat::
	.string "Oh, no! My beautiful POKéMON!$"

SSAqua_Interior18_Text_PokefanJeremy::
	.string "I must go to the POKéMON SALON and\n"
	.string "fix them up nice!$"

SSAqua_Interior18_Text_PokefanGeorgiaIntro::
	.string "I’m going to shop at the DEPT.STORE\n"
	.string "and then...$"

SSAqua_Interior18_Text_PokefanGeorgiaDefeat::
	.string "What was I going to do?$"

SSAqua_Interior18_Text_PokefanGeorgia::
	.string "Oh, yes! I have to get my POKéMON\n"
	.string "out of DAY-CARE!$"

SSAqua_Interior18_Text_PsychicRodneyIntro::
	.string "Ssh! My brain is picking up radio\n"
	.string "signals!$"

SSAqua_Interior18_Text_PsychicRodneyDefeat::
	.string "...I hear something!$"

SSAqua_Interior18_Text_PsychicRodney::
	.string "I get it. You can hear JOHTO’s radio\n"
	.string "on the FAST SHIP.$"
